= Installation

SBMM setup instructions go here.

== Mod Manager Setup

Getting started with SBMM:

- Download SBMM from the official GitHub
- Configure workshop directory path
- Set up mod groups matching wave structure

== First Mod Test

*Test Mod* is a QoL mod (v2024-01) available on the Steam Workshop. \
It has *no dependencies* and *no system impact*.

Install notes: Place in SBMM group 00-QoL-UI. No conflicts.

== Major Overhaul Test

*Frackin' Universe* is a Mechanics mod (v2024-06). \
Dependencies: xClient. \
System impact: adds research tree, new biomes, crafting.

Install notes: LOAD FIRST in SBMM group 04-Mechanics. Requires xClient. Start new save.
